WEBVTT

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:40.000
Man, it's hot.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:42.950
This thing is really hot!

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:44.820
You don't have a choice.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.690
We don't want to attract 
any unwanted attention

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:49.810
and right now, you're 
just too conspicuous.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:52.590
I didn't think you'd still 
be glowing this week.

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.560
It's a fine idea to cover 
my body's glow with this,

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.980
but I think this is 
also quite conspicuous.

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:00.470
I mean this is straight out of 
a mystery or horror show.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:03.210
Don't worry, it looks good on you.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:05.600
You look like a regular old degenerate.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.850
Just stay away from the kids, perv.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.540
Shut up, kid!

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.510
You dare talk to me like that?!

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:14.230
Eat my Muscle Flash!

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.430
If this sticks around for another week,

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.740
I can just do as I please.

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:19.910
Knock it off.

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.370
Didn't I just say that I want 
to stay under the radar?

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:32.630
This may be a podunk village, 
but the food is good.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.370
The ingredients are good.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.660
The seasoning isn't bad either.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.710
Hey, I'm hungry, too.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.810
We'll get your portion to go.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.060
You can eat it later when you're hidden.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.310
If you eat here, everyone 
will be staring at us.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.080
You know, I had to eat alone 
in the inn this morning,

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.430
and all I got was bread and water.

00:02:55.430 --> 00:02:56.900
I don't know if you guys are putting me

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.320
on a diet or if this 
is <i>A Little Princess</i>.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.620
Could I at least have a piece of cheese

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.070
or a slice of apple?

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.710
Just something!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.790
Hey! Don't!

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.780
Excuse me, check please!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.220
Just a minute!

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:26.150
Would that traveler 
care to show his face?

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:30.020
I'm sorry, but he has grave 
injuries all over his body.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.730
That's why he's dressed this way.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.300
Excuse me...

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.330
I'm just at that age, you know, 
everything is falling apart.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.230
If you'd just let me pass...

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.940
What are they trying to do?

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.660
Did Erec arrange this?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.240
Run!

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.960
Pet, Pet, Pet!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.230
This is bad!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.390
Uh...

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.060
Our Lord will come from the skies.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.990
His form will be radiant with light,

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:26.870
holy beasts will be His 
servants, and He will save us.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.330
Please save us, Lord.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.330
Actually, he's...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:38.940
...a god.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.630
Indeed!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.440
I have descended from the skies.

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.640
I have come from the heavens!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.140
I am your god!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.140
And these are my faithful 
servants three.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.310
Poseidon!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.770
Trans-Bowl!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.310
And Mini-Bowl!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.150
Y-You're the servant!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.360
And this is my sacred 
Beast o' Concealment.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:06.450
That shall be your cry for the week!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.490
This is so friggin' delicious!

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.730
I was starving, so that 
makes it extra delicious!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.230
What were you thinking?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:17.590
We don't know what they'll do to you

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:19.480
if we carelessly resist.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.150
That's why just going along 
with whatever they want

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:24.880
is the easiest way.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.640
Easy?

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.720
You told them you're a god!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.760
Must have been my personal virtues, 
I mean, my divine virtues.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.700
But this is just the glow

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.260
of the leftover Alma 
energy in your body.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.250
They don't have to know that.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.410
We'll just get out of here 
before they find out.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:41.090
So, look sharp, servant.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.060
I told you, you're the servant!

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.060
Pipe down, Mini-Bowl.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.450
Lord, everybody has gathered.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:52.950
What do you mean?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.430
They are awaiting you.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.620
Lord!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.980
Now what are you going to do?

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.770
You'll be in real trouble 
if they find out.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.950
I told you this was a bad idea!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.500
Please, oh Lord, we need a miracle.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.160
A miracle?

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.280
Yes.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.740
A miracle...

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:26.360
Then...

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:39.960
Let there be light!

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.380
That's it?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.470
That's not enough?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.600
Is this a miracle?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.060
I think he just gets along with bugs.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.720
Invincible!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.120
Lord, the fountain!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.620
Fountain?

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:21.370
The village fountain has 
been dry for many years now.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:24.080
Poseidon. That thing, please.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.110
Poseidon?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.400
Oh yeah. That's me.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:28.380
What thing?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.660
You know! That thing!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.930
The water...

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.530
Lord, it's a miracle!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.830
He is our Lord!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.370
Lord! Lord!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.190
Was that a miracle?

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.780
The water must have 
gotten agitated by Alma.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.210
Beginner's luck.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:05.810
I'm pretty awesome, don't you think?

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.380
Maybe in this world, I really am a god?

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.260
If you get too cocky, you'll fail.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.680
Not going to happen.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:14.000
I'm one of those so-called chosen ones,

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.260
here from another world.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.590
A god who appeared from 
the sky! That's right!

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:19.850
Hey, wait!

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:20.520
Hey!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.140
Hey guys! It's your god!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.230
Lord! Lord!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.760
Someone's full of himself.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.290
If they find out now...

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.760
We won't let that happen.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.990
We have to see this through.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:36.240
Tell us, oh Lord.

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:39.710
What was there in the beginning?

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:40.590
In the beginning?

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:41.430
Yes.

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.530
And then how did it progress?

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.750
<i>Like he can even talk 
about something like this.</i>

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.270
What was there in the beginning?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.180
The Big Bang!

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.710
A big bang?

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:58.760
Something big made a big bang!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:00.600
That was the NES!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.930
A gaming console in the living room!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.270
Happy family!

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:11.780
We are all part of one blessed family!

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.470
And yet, those times were 
still marked by strife.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:20.120
New systems were constantly 
appearing and disappearing again.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.560
Virtual reality that came too early

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.230
and realistic art that came too late.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.890
Where did everyone go

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.790
without the chance of being traded in?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.300
We are all survivors of 
a time full of strife!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.060
In the shadow of every 
winner stands a loser.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:39.420
Take the Saturn that never caught on.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.400
The Pippin that never kicked 
off its own dynasty.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.210
There was the Neogeo 
that sank into the sea.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:44.810
The Dream that never came true.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.600
The spectacular fail of the FX.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.690
The failed sound of the Omega Drive!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:53.190
Like the flickering stars, lives 
were born to fade away again!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.610
And yet!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:58.900
Progress could not be stopped!

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.000
From eight to sixteen!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.060
Thirty-two! Sixty-four!

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:05.580
Darwin!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.800
Darwin?

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.580
The one who <i>darts</i> forward and yells<i> win</i>!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.340
The victor!

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.400
Finally, the era of the 
portable devices arrived.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.130
The P! The DS!

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.800
We love portability!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.590
They have escaped the living room 
and dashed out into the world!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:22.190
Before long, all the people had 
scattered away from each other.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:23.460
Yet all these people

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:25.300
passing each other on the street 
needed a connection.

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.450
They all needed many friends!

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:30.100
The people who had been
 scattered came together again.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.730
And the networks...

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.610
The world exists because 
of these connections!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.680
Wii!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.610
Humans had triumphed!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.850
Online!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:47.120
We are always connected!

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:50.350
3D will soon be ours!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.450
The future is ours to grasp!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:57.540
Kon-trol!

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.230
Kon-trol! Kon-trol!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.200
Hey, good morning!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.620
Konpika-sama, they are 
waiting for your words.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.230
Yes.

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.740
Not this again.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.740
What will we do today?

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.990
Lord, is there such a 
thing as reincarnation?

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.680
That depends on your items 
and your remaining credits.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:29.270
Gather hearts, search for the 
leaves of the World Tree,

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:30.750
and conserve your MP!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.750
You must be virtuous 
and avoid extravagance!

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.210
Objection!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.030
If you really are a god, 
then you must save all of mankind!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.810
Those who don't better themselves

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:47.060
and idly let a 1UP slip by 
will only hold the rest back!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.150
They will end up having to toss in

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.930
another coin to continue!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.030
What do you mean by "cointucontinew"?

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:56.750
It means buying your life with 
money, you insolent fool!

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:01.240
Kon-trol! Kon-trol! Kon-trol!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.500
Lord! Did you create the world?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.760
The world was created by gods.

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.560
The Engineers who developed it,

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.250
and the Creators who brought it to be.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.580
First, there was the god who 
created the heavens and the earth,

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.630
and then there was the 
god who created life.

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:16.080
Objection!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:21.630
The earth came to be by itself, 
as did all life upon it!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.850
Now that is a crap game.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.140
A what?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.430
Something that dies 
quickly and ends quickly!

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.080
Do you really want to 
waste time in a world

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.360
so random and nonsensical?!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:35.150
A world cannot be created without

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.980
debugging and proper calculations!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.610
Lord, does the world end somewhere?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.630
Every map and terrain has an end.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.950
When you scroll, you see repetition.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.740
There are capacity limits.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.490
The world is finite.

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:50.740
Objection!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.240
If you say the world is contained

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.830
like an egg is contained in 
its shell, then tell me,

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.000
what lies beyond the shell?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.500
That would be

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.510
offline satisfaction!

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:03.510
What?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.600
Do you honestly think 
someone as miserable as you

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.720
can begin to comprehend such a concept?!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.550
A better world that awaits us...

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:13.060
Even I can only humbly 
guess at such things!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:16.230
It's time you realize that man 
simply cannot know everything!

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.680
Kon-sumer!

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:23.240
Kon-sumer!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:26.110
Kon-vention!

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.780
Kon-vention!

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.620
Anyone bringing foodstuffs, over here.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.890
Anyone bringing gold 
or silver, over here.

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:39.670
Anything else, over here.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.170
Kon-vention!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.790
Kon-trol!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.380
Kon-sumer!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.640
Kon-pact!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.260
Kon-pact!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.790
Konpika-sama, are you ready to speak?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:54.950
I am, so listen up.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.270
Save meticulously!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.550
Save meticulously!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:01.620
Especially if you're about 
to begin a big event.

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:02.620
This is an iron rule.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.030
You will be tested on this later.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:05.760
He teaches us that we must

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.660
take meticulous care if we 
want to achieve something.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.500
This is the life!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.620
Konpika-sama, open wide.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.060
Open wide.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.520
This is heaven, heaven!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.800
May we have a word with 
you, Konpika-sama?

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:38.410
And?

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.090
How depraved do you want to get?

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:42.220
It's only a matter of time 
before they find out.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:43.800
It's time to run.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.340
It's all good.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.780
I mean, it's not often 
that I get to be a god.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.120
That can wait until I've gotten 
an even better treatment.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.120
What do you mean?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.610
I am after all a living god,

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:02.070
so I'd like them to build 
me this really huge temple.

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.240
That will be the holy land, Akihabara

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:07.850
and I'll have 48 beautiful 
temple maidens

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:10.410
and amass enough gold to swim in it.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.140
Enough with this fake god stunt!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.750
I'm no fake!

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.040
As long as I've got this glow,

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.750
and as long as I've got 
people worshiping me,

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.360
I really am a god.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:25.650
Is this what you came to this world for?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.420
What is your purpose?!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.570
Why are you traveling with us?!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.470
U-Um...

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.670
You're the one who has lost his way.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.650
You're not fit to be guiding others!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.180
I...

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.270
Konpika-sama!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.800
We need you!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.010
You must show yourself to the believers.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:00.900
The Konpika religion gains 
new followers every day

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.220
and it's a riot out there!

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:03.690
Just let them see you.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:09.690
Konpika-sama! That's him! 
He really does glow!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.030
Kon... Kon-vict...

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.450
No matter what I do, 
the shine gets through.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.130
We missed our window.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.250
Well, right now, 
running is all we've got.

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.060
Can't you control the shine somehow?

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:28.320
We're here right now because I can't.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:29.920
I even peed myself a little out there,

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.260
so don't ask too much of me.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.230
We can't get out the front.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.070
Konpika-sama!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.030
Where are you going?

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:58.660
I am going to resume my travels.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.040
Are you going to preach 
in other locations?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.610
S-Something like that, yes.

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:03.750
I will go with you!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.280
All the believers will follow you!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.960
But that's...

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:12.000
The Konpika faith has an 
unprecedented following!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.220
It can go toe-to-toe with 
the Ulga religious sorority!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.900
That's right!

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:18.280
First we should go south, to the 
Ulga sorority's headquarters!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:20.260
Let us deliver holy war unto them!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.520
No way!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:22.760
Yeah, nope!

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:24.140
Nothing to do with the Ulga sorority!

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.770
Don't do anything against them.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.890
But some of the believers 
already started going south.

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.910
Call them back right now!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:32.920
As you command!

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.750
But, Konpika-sama,

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.530
the tide is in our favor right now.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.030
The Konpika faith is pacifistic!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.890
We don't use the "Fight" command,

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:42.540
<b>Run                        Priest
Allies                      Sage1
Items                      Sage2</b>

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:42.540
<b>Kon                      </b>Command                      Name

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.540
we use "Run" or "Allies"!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.210
But you have to answer

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.670
to the hearts of those who worship you!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.130
A crusade!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.840
With you at the front!

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:53.920
It's not a god's job to find an outlet

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.630
for that kind of pent-up energy!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.530
Damn it!

00:17:57.530 --> 00:18:01.520
You have that much energy to spare?!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.980
That's it! That's what we need! Yeah!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.370
This place has become too 
small for the Konpika faith!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.330
We need a holy land!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.080
That shall be known as 
the Holy Land Akiba!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.120
Everybody needs to work together

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.530
and build a magnificent temple there!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.590
Kon-struction!

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.860
Kon-struction!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.150
Kon-struction...

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:48.130
All right, I managed to create 
an outlet for their energy.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:50.050
But really, what is this?

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:52.360
A public service to combat unemployment?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.780
Should I have gone for a pyramid?

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.560
It's better than clashing 
with the Ulga sorority.

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:00.050
But it's also only delaying the problem.

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.410
If we can't do it stealthily,

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:03.080
then we just have to force our way out.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.290
Through that many people?

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.580
I don't want to hurt the people.

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:10.680
Hey, old man, what are you doing?

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:13.880
Since you want to build a temple,

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.710
I thought I'd oversee the design for you.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.080
Excuse me?

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.660
Are you mocking me?

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:22.750
Like you want to make it 
an amateurish crap temple?

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.660
I've completed my studies 
in engineering and architecture

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.850
at the university 
in the empire's capital.

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:30.730
Yeah right, even your 
brain is made of muscles.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.330
Sainglain graduated top of his class.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.510
He's not like a certain 
moron we all know.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.210
Huh?

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:44.450
Y-You guys are all way too 
different from how you appear!

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:10.810
Konpika-sama, a word, if you please.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:21.620
Kon-plete!

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:24.820
What is this heat?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.700
But we need more, shine more, Kon!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:33.710
Kon-verter!

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.760
What is that thing?!

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:52.940
Konpika-sama is going to 
return to the heavens now.

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.320
B-But...

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:56.310
We need further guidance!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.610
Farewell!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.990
Konpika-sama has returned 
to the heavens.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.030
Let us follow his teachings

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:15.080
and develop this holy land further!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:21.590
Konpika! Konpika! Konpika!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:24.590
Well done, Sainglain.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.560
You are too kind.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.550
Hey, I'm the engine here.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.100
No words for me?

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:35.180
You're the one who got 
us into this mess,

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.110
so you'd better make it fly, servant!

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:40.860
Hey, it's not like I 
chose to shine like thi—

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.450
I told you to make it fly.
Are you disobeying me?

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:45.580
You say disobey, but you know,

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.830
I couldn't turn it off until now.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:50.870
And now it just turned off.
 There you have it.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:54.530
Does that mean the Alma energy 
in your body is used up?

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:57.400
Oh, I see. I'm out of energy.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:58.880
So it's finally gone.

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:01.420
Wait, that wasn't planned.

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.620
I need you to shine a bit longer or...

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.160
Shine one more time, servant!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.330
Pika...

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:13.850
...chu!

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:15.580
Do it, Kon!

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:17.230
Put your heart into it!

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:23.400
Chu!!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:26.110
It's no good, something else came out...

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:24.810
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:12.270
Guided by a mysterious woman,

00:24:12.270 --> 00:24:14.550
I've arrived at the workshop 
of the Takumis.

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:17.390
There I was given new Alma gear.

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:19.330
Just you wait, DT!

00:24:19.330 --> 00:24:23.470
I will defeat you with 
this holy sword, Calibre!

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:29.990
Meanwhile, the four officers

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:29.990
of Incognito await Erec's return,

00:24:29.990 --> 00:24:35.130
each insisting that he

00:24:29.990 --> 00:24:35.130
is Erec's true right-hand man.
